{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9fcbde3f94ac66e83f60200923d1056e8f1a199d12a65fd7e79f7c239db1de19", "ja": "（先日の体験教室ロケは、なかなか評判が良かった。\nこの分だと、次の仕事に繋がるかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（先前到体验教室出外景得到非常好的评价。\n照这样子看来，或许能接到下一份工作呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "909d1265b174308bb0ff5f233f7cdd10cfc1f0e35f40c02789ddf7a87e364dab", "ja": "失礼します……あ、{$P$}さん。\n今、いいですか？", "zh": "打扰了……啊，{$P$}先生。\n你现在有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1e5c4d5fb87cddf3f2237e161bfc168888787dd9c960ccff95460b6a63e3619e", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保。\n大丈夫だけど、何か用事か？", "zh": "辛苦了，志保。\n有空啊，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "cffc6fd90381067b207a06ef95e225af28aa06a77661c0a46b228b01be4be386", "ja": "はい。この前の陶芸体験で作った湯のみなんですけど、\nひとつ、給湯室に置いておいてもいいですか？", "zh": "嗯，我之前去陶艺体验教室做了茶杯，\n我想问可不可以放一个在茶水间？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "d269e96cb00915fa3b321fb2b25ab9635eb5af639ffdea4b04af4e44d97346c2", "ja": "お茶を飲む時に、使おうかと思って。", "zh": "这样喝茶时就能拿来使用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "01fa828e7b9789b5d007646a2043c12b68bc73c592afd862c943b9d92700ce70", "ja": "ああ、もちろん構わないよ。\nそれより志保、陶芸は楽しかったか？", "zh": "好啊，当然没问题。\n话说志保，陶艺有趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "eb50b74fbdac00a6dc5583cdd06e15f8b48585cb77567e3f892a78d52f3cd490", "ja": "あ、はい。楽しいというか……新鮮でした。\n最初は、難しく感じてたんですけど。", "zh": "啊，是。与其说是有趣……不如说是新鲜吧。\n虽然我一开始觉得很难就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "b1b25cd427f47f0d3975bc086ebd8f03f3dd97aea54949a980fff870081fcdf9", "ja": "段々とコツがつかめていって。\nそれで、気がついたら、いくつも湯のみを……。", "zh": "后来渐渐抓到诀窍，\n不知不觉间，就完成了好几个茶杯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "06aec10cd41f2a9819bae34ed92801efb8dcc6a3ccb4aa47e82afc8abf4c8413", "ja": "なるほど。\nそんなにたくさん作っちゃったのか？", "zh": "原来如此。\n你做了那么多个啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "e364e22a3406b8397803b4adef28f30ca84bf40426e649831a067aca7d790231", "ja": "はい。集中していたら、\n時間の過ぎるのが、あっという間でした。", "zh": "嗯，专心做着做着，\n时间一下子就过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fd4018faf92f4d15ff4f3221befa7365aac707d9522a50716b1681a9582fb0dd", "ja": "そうか……レッスンの時と同じなんだな。", "zh": "这样喔……就跟你在练习时一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "ff4a3ab66c6b05aeb24f7b1c56f2f1295a6dfabb889b76400afe846d5be2eeeb", "ja": "レッスンの時……？", "zh": "跟我在练习时一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1012_p", "source_sha256": "69a80dd96afa00c2bfa65d06f806a70cbb0cc9643515342c468aee3343fa2ebb", "ja": "志保はいつも、レッスンルームに誰か入ってきても\nすぐには気が付かないくらい、集中してるだろう？", "zh": "志保平时在练习时不也都专心到\n有人进练习室也不会马上发觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "37f1c44919cc4a083165492f263b1144b58cac99763e97646dee205a8483376b", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nもしかして、私のレッスンを見てたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你该不会是有偷看我练习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "1ecc460bf2963f8dc4ce2f7395e4b3f6a0a0ae00a2002fbcff03a9cd0adc7c9e", "ja": "はぁ……黙って見ているくらいなら、\nちゃんと声をかけてください。", "zh": "唉……与其默默在旁边看，\n不如直接跟我说一声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "308715a391914d2ec197bb867db5e62aae642d708cd6d1f4ff1e79f73178b952", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、\n見てほしいところがあるかもしれませんから。", "zh": "说不定我会有什么地方\n想请{$P$}先生帮忙纠正。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cfd5cd87ce85c063aedd0e4076d484fc3e4d38a7d5f2e02f8df2aed66623627d", "ja": "あっ、そうだな。\nわかった、今度から声を掛けるようにするよ。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。\n我知道了，下次开始我会跟你说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "ff0b1ba552e234affec2085ee03e58820446220d250af4ef39c44df5469a10c1", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。……ところで、\nどうせ休憩するなら、お茶を飲みませんか。", "zh": "麻烦了……话说回来，\n既然都要休息了，要不要喝杯茶呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "a7f67d7df87f8b076893f0e7e20083a2f1f81ef23f8e935e3924b975dc341055", "ja": "{$P$}さん、時間大丈夫ですよね。\n私、淹れてきますから。待っててください。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你还有时间对吧。\n我这就去泡茶，请你等我一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0133_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1d9eb29394909634c894320bd0b882361ca5b9e4bca987eadffb35dea9c18bf3", "ja": "（その後、志保が作った湯のみで、お茶を飲んだ。\nうん……手作りって、いいものだな）", "zh": "（之后志保用她做的茶杯泡了茶给我喝。\n嗯……手工做的，感觉还真不错呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
